/T (Bridge IEventPublisher to RabbitMQ through a transactional outbox. Order row + outbox row written in the same DB transaction. Relay reads unpublished rows in order and marks them published. Topic exchange per concern. Routing keys carry the BU. Durable queues, manual ack, dead-letter. Idempotency on \(aggregate_id, version\).)
/E (Bridge IEventPublisher to RabbitMQ through a transactional outbox. Order row + outbox row written in the same DB transaction. Relay reads unpublished rows in order and marks them published. Topic exchange per concern. Routing keys carry the BU. Durable queues, manual ack, dead-letter. Idempotency on \(aggregate_id, version\).)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
